"surface":"庶長改","kind":"person","person_id":"cr3_n7l_ek6","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m053-0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"靈公","kind":"person","person_id":"y97_huh_vuz_AAAAAAAAAAAAABAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m053-0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"獻公","kind":"person","person_id":"y97_huh_vuz_AAAAAAAAAAAAABAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m053-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"出子","kind":"person","person_id":"y97_huh_vuz_AAAAAAAAAAAAABABAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m053-0026","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"其母","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未定指代、群體或官稱；商君語為篇章指引，不當作獨立個人。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-005-qin","book_id":"b-shiji-005","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-005-qin"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:p055","text":"孝公元年，河山以東彊國六，與齊威、楚宣、魏惠、燕悼、韓哀、趙成侯并。淮泗之閒小國十餘。楚、魏與秦接界。魏筑長城，自鄭濱洛以北，有上郡。楚自漢中，南有巴、黔中。周室微，諸侯力政，爭相併。秦僻在雍州，不與中國諸侯之會盟，夷翟遇之。孝公於是布惠，振孤寡，招戰士，明功賞。下令國中曰：「昔我繆公自岐雍之閒，修德行武，東平晉亂，以河為界，西霸戎翟，廣地千里，天子致伯，諸侯畢賀，為後世開業，甚光美。會往者厲、躁、簡公、出子之不寧，國家內憂，未遑外事，三晉攻奪我先君河西地，諸侯卑秦、醜莫大焉。獻公即位，鎮撫邊境，徙治櫟陽，且欲東伐，復繆公之故地，修繆公之政令。寡人思念先君之意，常痛於心。賓客群臣有能出奇計彊秦者，吾且尊官，與之分土。」於是乃出兵東圍陜城，西斬戎之獂王。","annotation_status":"in_progress","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m055-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"孝公","kind":"person","person_id":"y97_huh_vuz_AAAAAAAAAAAAABAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m055-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"齊威","kind":"person","person_id":"uhq_4sb_zzv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m055-0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"楚宣","kind":"person","person_id":"1tl_xlo_url","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m055-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"魏惠","kind":"person","person_id":"bhp_5xd_88r","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m055-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"燕悼","kind":"person","person_id":"d77_fah_85y","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m055-0026","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"韓哀","kind":"person","person_id":"clj_4gu_9bw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m055-0029","start":29,"end":32,"surface":"趙成侯","kind":"person","person_id":"8nv_485_mex","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m055-0113","start":113,"end":115,"surface":"孝公","kind":"person","person_id":"y97_huh_vuz_AAAAAAAAAAAAABAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m055-0141","start":141,"end":143,"surface":"繆公","kind":"person","person_id":"y97_huh_vuz_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m055-0197","start":197,"end":200,"surface":"厲、躁","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未定指代、群體或官稱；商君語為篇章指引，不當作獨立個人。"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m055-0201","start":201,"end":203,"surface":"簡公","kind":"person","person_id":"y97_huh_vuz_AAAAAAAAAAAAABAB","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m055-0204","start":204,"end":206,"surface":"出子","kind":"person","person_id":"y97_huh_vuz_AAAAAAAAAAAAABABAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m055-0225","start":225,"end":227,"surface":"先君","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未定指代、群體或官稱；商君語為篇章指引，不當作獨立個人。"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m055-0241","start":241,"end":243,"surface":"獻公","kind":"person","person_id":"y97_huh_vuz_AAAAAAAAAAAAABAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m055-0262","start":262,"end":264,"surface":"繆公","kind":"person","person_id":"y97_huh_vuz_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m055-0269","start":269,"end":271,"surface":"繆公","kind":"person","person_id":"y97_huh_vuz_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m055-0279","start":279,"end":281,"surface":"先君","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未定指代、群體或官稱；商君語為篇章指引，不當作獨立個人。"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m055-0327","start":327,"